##

00:00:00.280 --> 00:00:03.280 align:start size:72% position:28% line:7%
<c.colorCCCCCC><i>♪ (jazzy theme music)</i></c>

00:00:00.280 --> 00:00:02.610 line:91%
<i>I invited friends to
play some games in a pub.</i>

00:00:02.610 --> 00:00:03.950 line:85%
<i>No big prizes for the winner,</i>

00:00:03.950 --> 00:00:05.720 line:91%
<i>just bragging rights and
a plug for their channel</i>

00:00:05.720 --> 00:00:06.750 line:85%
<i>at the end of the video.</i>

00:00:06.750 --> 00:00:09.600 line:68%
<i>Joining me are science broadcaster
and poker champion Liv Boeree,</i>

00:00:09.600 --> 00:00:11.940 line:68%
<i>cardiologist Rohin Francis
from Medlife Crisis,</i>

00:00:11.940 --> 00:00:14.070 line:68%
<i>and crossword and sudoku
expert Mark Goodliffe</i>

00:00:14.070 --> 00:00:15.560 line:64%
<i>from Cracking the Cryptic.</i>

00:00:19.000 --> 00:00:20.770 line:85%
Liv, Rohin, Mark.

00:00:20.770 --> 00:00:22.560 line:91%
Thank you very much for joining
me in the back of the pub.

00:00:22.560 --> 00:00:25.240 line:91%
The game is Skull and
here's how it's played.

00:00:25.240 --> 00:00:28.530 line:91%
<i>Each player has four cards:
three flowers and one skull.</i>

00:00:28.530 --> 00:00:30.560 line:91%
<i>To start, everyone
plays one card face down</i>

00:00:30.560 --> 00:00:32.520 position:66% line:64%
<i>and then each player in turn has a choice:</i>

00:00:32.520 --> 00:00:34.630 position:61% line:64%
<i>play another card or start the bidding.</i>

00:00:34.630 --> 00:00:36.820 line:68%
<i>Once someone bids, no
more cards are played.</i>

00:00:36.820 --> 00:00:38.280 line:64%
<i>Each player can either up the bid</i>

00:00:38.280 --> 00:00:40.450 line:64%
<i>or pass and sit out of the round.</i>

00:00:40.450 --> 00:00:42.520 line:68%
<i>Whoever gives the highest
bid then has to turn over</i>

00:00:42.520 --> 00:00:46.050 line:23%
<i>that many flowers without
revealing a single skull.</i>

00:00:46.050 --> 00:00:48.970 line:23%
<i>And they have to turn over
all their own cards first.</i>

00:00:48.970 --> 00:00:51.700 line:8%
<i>Succeed and they win a point,
but if they turn over a skull,</i>

00:00:51.700 --> 00:00:54.640 position:63% line:7%
<i>no points and they lose one random card.</i>

00:00:54.640 --> 00:00:56.400 line:21%
<i>Lose all your cards and you're out.</i>

00:00:56.400 --> 00:00:58.273 line:64%
<i>First to two points wins the game.</i>

00:00:59.240 --> 00:01:03.193 line:91%
If we're all ready, we all put
down one card to start off.

00:01:06.120 --> 00:01:08.200 line:85%
And you're to my right.

00:01:08.200 --> 00:01:11.428 line:91%
You can either play a card
or you can start the bidding.

00:01:11.428 --> 00:01:13.345 line:85%
<c.colorFFAAFF>I play a card.</c>

00:01:27.008 --> 00:01:29.650 position:56% line:85%
A lot of cards are on the table now.

00:01:29.650 --> 00:01:30.823 line:85%
<c.colorFFAAFF>Let's keep it going.</c>

00:01:37.820 --> 00:01:39.520 line:85%
<c.yellow>So to start the bidding I...</c>

00:01:39.520 --> 00:01:41.370 line:91%
Just say a number.
<c.yellow>Say a number.</c>

00:01:43.906 --> 00:01:44.739 line:85%
<c.yellow>Five.</c>

00:01:48.823 --> 00:01:51.550 position:59% line:85%
Ah, that's a really good bid. <i>(laughs)</i>

00:01:51.550 --> 00:01:53.620 line:85%
I would absolutely have bid five.

00:01:53.620 --> 00:01:54.990 line:91%
No, you know what?
I'm going to pass.

00:01:54.990 --> 00:01:57.140 line:91%
I'm going to let you two
argue this out. Pass.

00:02:00.540 --> 00:02:01.463 line:85%
<c.colorFFAAFF>Six.</c>

00:02:02.850 --> 00:02:04.480 line:85%
<c.yellow>Aggressive.</c>

00:02:04.480 --> 00:02:05.313 line:85%
<c.cyan>How many cards have we got?</c>

00:02:05.313 --> 00:02:07.889 line:85%
There's two down here.

00:02:07.889 --> 00:02:09.747 line:85%
<c.colorFFAAFF>So it's three there.</c>

00:02:09.747 --> 00:02:11.090 line:85%
It's three there— Oh, damn it.

00:02:11.090 --> 00:02:12.590 line:85%
I should totally have bid six.

00:02:14.449 --> 00:02:15.282 line:85%
<c.cyan>Pass.</c>

00:02:19.030 --> 00:02:19.980 line:85%
<c.yellow>Nine cards.</c>

00:02:21.920 --> 00:02:23.307 position:58% line:85%
It's not enough information to go on.

00:02:23.307 --> 00:02:24.833 line:85%
Not on the first round.

00:02:27.430 --> 00:02:28.790 line:85%
<c.yellow>Pass.</c>

00:02:28.790 --> 00:02:31.060 line:85%
All right, that's three passes.

00:02:31.060 --> 00:02:33.090 line:85%
Six is the bid.

00:02:33.090 --> 00:02:36.799 line:85%
<c.colorFFAAFF>One, two, three.</c>

00:02:36.799 --> 00:02:38.295 line:85%
(sighs)

00:02:40.410 --> 00:02:44.510 line:85%
<c.colorFFAAFF>I'll have the first of Liv's. Four.</c>

00:02:44.510 --> 00:02:46.430 line:85%
<c.colorFFAAFF>The first of Tom's.</c>

00:02:46.430 --> 00:02:47.263 line:85%
That's five.

00:02:47.263 --> 00:02:49.630 line:91%
<c.colorFFAAFF>Five.</c>
<i>(sighs)</i>

00:02:49.630 --> 00:02:50.463 line:85%
<c.colorFFAAFF>And Liv's.</c>

00:02:52.220 --> 00:02:53.762 line:91%
<c.colorFFAAFF>Six.</c>
<c.colorEEEEEE>Whoa.</c>

00:02:53.762 --> 00:02:55.800 line:91%
<c.yellow>Nice.</c>
<c.cyan>Very good play.</c>

00:02:55.800 --> 00:02:56.962 line:85%
<c.yellow>I want to see what you had.</c>

00:02:56.962 --> 00:02:58.647 line:85%
<c.colorCCCCCC><i>(group laughing)</i></c>

00:02:58.647 --> 00:02:59.980 line:85%
For the benefit of the audience,

00:02:59.980 --> 00:03:04.440 line:91%
can we all turn away
and Rohin can show

00:03:04.440 --> 00:03:05.480 line:85%
what he had to the camera.

00:03:05.480 --> 00:03:06.930 line:85%
<c.colorFFAAFF>Oh the handy mirror.</c>

00:03:06.930 --> 00:03:08.227 line:85%
Yeah, don't look in the mirror.

00:03:08.227 --> 00:03:10.130 line:91%
<c.colorFFAAFF><i>(laughs)</i></c>
<c.colorEEEEEE>There we go.</c>

00:03:10.130 --> 00:03:15.130 line:91%
I'm also, if you would turn
away, going to just show that.

00:03:15.140 --> 00:03:17.100 line:85%
There we go. Thank you.

00:03:17.100 --> 00:03:22.100 line:91%
Right. So, you flip your
mat on the very first one.

00:03:22.270 --> 00:03:23.680 line:91%
<c.cyan>Ah.</c>
<c.colorEEEEEE>Phew, this could be</c>

00:03:23.680 --> 00:03:25.060 line:85%
a short game, folks.

00:03:25.060 --> 00:03:26.550 line:85%
This could be short. Right.

00:03:26.550 --> 00:03:27.993 line:85%
Card down, please.

00:03:34.396 --> 00:03:36.063 line:85%
And it is your move.

00:03:36.940 --> 00:03:39.413 line:85%
<c.colorFFAAFF>Okay, I will put a card down.</c>

00:03:43.890 --> 00:03:44.723 line:85%
<c.cyan>Three.</c>

00:03:48.380 --> 00:03:50.186 line:91%
<c.yellow>So, silly question, I can't
add another card now?</c>

00:03:50.186 --> 00:03:52.319 line:91%
You can't add another card now.
<c.yellow>Okay.</c>

00:03:54.287 --> 00:03:56.703 line:85%
And there's only five on the table.

00:04:01.150 --> 00:04:04.043 line:85%
<c.yellow>Hmm. Nice play.</c>

00:04:05.170 --> 00:04:09.253 line:85%
<c.yellow>Three. Pass.</c>

00:04:10.704 --> 00:04:12.729 line:91%
I was really hoping
you weren't going to bet.

00:04:12.729 --> 00:04:13.890 line:85%
<c.colorCCCCCC><i>(group laughing)</i></c>

00:04:13.890 --> 00:04:17.110 line:91%
I am convinced that
every one of you sods

00:04:17.110 --> 00:04:21.270 line:91%
has put a skull down, so
I am not going to bid.

00:04:21.270 --> 00:04:22.740 line:85%
I'm going to pass as well.

00:04:22.740 --> 00:04:24.190 line:85%
I think you've put a skull down

00:04:24.190 --> 00:04:26.440 line:91%
and you're trying to bait me
into four.

00:04:26.440 --> 00:04:27.290 line:91%
<c.colorFFAAFF>Wow.</c>
<c.colorEEEEEE>Pass.</c>

00:04:27.290 --> 00:04:29.250 line:91%
<c.colorFFAAFF>He's called everyone
as putting a skull down.</c>

00:04:29.250 --> 00:04:31.573 line:91%
Mhm.
<c.colorFFAAFF>Well, I'm passing.</c>

00:04:32.410 --> 00:04:34.494 line:91%
That's a skull. That's
totally— <i>(sighs)</i>

00:04:34.494 --> 00:04:35.620 line:85%
<c.colorFFAAFF>Wrong there.</c>

00:04:35.620 --> 00:04:37.580 line:91%
<c.cyan>But now where do I go?
</c><c.colorFFAAFF>Now you have to pick two more.</c>

00:04:39.000 --> 00:04:39.833 line:85%
<c.colorFFAAFF>Tom.</c>

00:04:42.610 --> 00:04:43.853 line:91%
Two.
<c.cyan>Two.</c>

00:04:48.637 --> 00:04:50.060 line:85%
<c.colorCCCCCC><i>(group sighs)</i></c>

00:04:50.060 --> 00:04:51.810 line:91%
<c.colorFFAAFF>Well done.
</c><c.cyan>Nice.</c>

00:04:51.810 --> 00:04:53.540 line:85%
<c.yellow>I was so sure that was a skull.</c>

00:04:53.540 --> 00:04:54.460 line:85%
<c.yellow>The way you've put it down.</c>

00:04:54.460 --> 00:04:55.667 line:85%
Yeah, I was sure.

00:04:55.667 --> 00:04:59.150 line:91%
For the benefit of the audience,
we're going to look away.

00:04:59.150 --> 00:05:00.700 line:85%
Liv, could you show the camera?

00:05:02.000 --> 00:05:03.890 line:85%
And we're all going to look away.

00:05:03.890 --> 00:05:06.330 line:85%
Mark, if you could show the camera.

00:05:06.330 --> 00:05:07.163 line:85%
Thank you.

00:05:08.930 --> 00:05:10.995 line:91%
I'm looking forward to
seeing what those were,

00:05:10.995 --> 00:05:15.480 line:85%
'cause I was convinced that...

00:05:15.480 --> 00:05:16.970 line:85%
Ah, okay, fine.

00:05:16.970 --> 00:05:19.430 line:91%
Well this is a dangerous position.
No one's even lost a card yet.

00:05:24.450 --> 00:05:26.689 line:91%
<c.yellow>Is it on?
So we all put one in.</c>

00:05:26.689 --> 00:05:27.522 line:85%
<c.cyan>Oh, yeah. Okay.</c>

00:05:29.650 --> 00:05:30.483 line:85%
It's on you.

00:05:45.850 --> 00:05:46.683 line:85%
<c.cyan>Three.</c>

00:05:49.749 --> 00:05:51.143 line:85%
<c.yellow>Four.</c>

00:05:51.143 --> 00:05:52.710 line:85%
Oh, I'm not doing five.

00:05:52.710 --> 00:05:54.450 line:85%
There's no way I'm doing that, no.

00:05:54.450 --> 00:05:56.200 line:85%
There's landmines all round here.

00:05:56.200 --> 00:05:59.033 line:91%
<c.colorFFAAFF>There's eight cards down,
but I'm still going to pass.</c>

00:06:00.800 --> 00:06:02.350 line:85%
<c.cyan>I'll pass.</c>

00:06:02.350 --> 00:06:03.790 line:85%
<c.yellow>Right.</c>

00:06:03.790 --> 00:06:05.470 line:85%
Your own first.

00:06:05.470 --> 00:06:06.730 line:85%
<c.yellow>Wait, I have to do my own first?</c>

00:06:06.730 --> 00:06:07.859 line:85%
Yeah.

00:06:07.859 --> 00:06:09.730 line:91%
<c.yellow><i>(bleep)
</i></c><c.colorCCCCCC><i>(group laughing)</i></c>

00:06:09.730 --> 00:06:12.250 line:91%
We did say that several
times. That has...

00:06:14.410 --> 00:06:15.243 line:85%
<c.yellow>Okay.</c>

00:06:15.243 --> 00:06:17.430 line:91%
Ah, that's—
<c.yellow>Did not realise that.</c>

00:06:17.430 --> 00:06:18.864 line:85%
To to be fair,

00:06:18.864 --> 00:06:20.397 line:91%
yeah, you...
<c.yellow>I'm screwed then.</c>

00:06:20.397 --> 00:06:21.876 line:91%
<c.colorFFAAFF>And here.
</c><c.yellow>Oh wow.</c>

00:06:21.876 --> 00:06:24.923 line:91%
<c.yellow>Wow, wow, my god!
</c><c.colorCCCCCC><i>[group laughing]</i></c>

00:06:24.923 --> 00:06:26.700 line:91%
<c.yellow>See I told you, poker
skills, bluffing skills...</c>

00:06:26.700 --> 00:06:28.680 line:85%
<c.colorFFAAFF>Own first didn't matter there.</c>

00:06:28.680 --> 00:06:31.690 line:91%
Okay, there was no way
you could've won that one.

00:06:31.690 --> 00:06:33.200 line:91%
Technically you knocked
yourself out there,

00:06:33.200 --> 00:06:36.920 line:91%
so one of us takes a card
at random from your pile.

00:06:36.920 --> 00:06:39.620 position:66% line:85%
Ideally, you don't want to lose the skull.

00:06:39.620 --> 00:06:42.230 line:91%
We'll see how it goes.
I'll take that one.

00:06:42.230 --> 00:06:44.630 line:91%
If that was a card force,
it was done very well.

00:06:45.840 --> 00:06:46.673 line:85%
Lovely, all right.

00:06:46.673 --> 00:06:47.877 line:85%
<c.yellow>So I need to turn this over?</c>

00:06:47.877 --> 00:06:48.710 line:91%
No, no.
<c.yellow>No.</c>

00:06:48.710 --> 00:06:49.543 line:85%
<c.yellow>Oh no, I stay like this.</c>

00:06:49.543 --> 00:06:52.840 line:91%
Stay like this.
All right, next round.

00:06:52.840 --> 00:06:55.460 line:85%
And Liv, it is you to start.

00:06:55.460 --> 00:06:57.200 line:85%
So one card down by default

00:06:58.620 --> 00:07:01.403 line:91%
and now your first move,
another card or a bid.

00:07:23.820 --> 00:07:24.965 line:85%
<c.yellow>Three.</c>

00:07:24.965 --> 00:07:25.798 line:85%
Four.

00:07:27.730 --> 00:07:30.414 line:91%
That was a bad bid and
I answered too quickly.

00:07:30.414 --> 00:07:31.362 line:91%
<c.cyan>Yeah.
</c><c.yellow>So fast!</c>

00:07:31.362 --> 00:07:32.590 line:91%
Damn it.
<c.cyan>I know,</c>

00:07:32.590 --> 00:07:35.109 line:91%
<c.cyan>but with you I'm never sure
if it's a double bluff.</c>

00:07:35.109 --> 00:07:38.660 line:91%
<c.yellow>- Yeah, but then he says this,
so now why would he feign...?</c>

00:07:38.660 --> 00:07:40.383 line:91%
<c.colorFFAAFF>Five.
</c><c.cyan>Ooh.</c>

00:07:41.390 --> 00:07:43.450 line:91%
What I should have bid.
I would happily have bid five.

00:07:43.450 --> 00:07:47.083 line:91%
<c.cyan>I was going to go for five,
but don't know if I can do a six.</c>

00:07:51.650 --> 00:07:52.483 line:85%
<c.cyan>Six.</c>

00:07:54.576 --> 00:07:55.750 line:85%
<c.yellow>Pass.</c>

00:07:55.750 --> 00:07:56.910 line:91%
Seven.
<c.cyan>Ooh!</c>

00:07:58.187 --> 00:07:59.354 line:91%
<c.colorFFAAFF>Pass.
</c><c.cyan>Pass.</c>

00:08:01.360 --> 00:08:02.510 line:64%
I've got two.

00:08:02.510 --> 00:08:04.190 line:91%
I don't think you'd make
the same mistake twice,

00:08:04.190 --> 00:08:06.590 line:91%
or it's the best bluff
ever, so let's see yours.

00:08:08.565 --> 00:08:10.315 line:68%
<c.yellow>There we go.
</c><c.colorEEEEEE>Four.</c>

00:08:13.490 --> 00:08:15.873 line:91%
Top one of both of yours,
please. Rohin first.

00:08:19.683 --> 00:08:23.160 line:85%
<i>(sighs)</i><c.colorEEEEEE> One of those is a skull.</c>

00:08:23.160 --> 00:08:24.400 line:85%
I'm sure one of those is a skull.

00:08:24.400 --> 00:08:26.920 line:91%
<c.colorFFAAFF>How would it work, that
you know that one is a skull?</c>

00:08:26.920 --> 00:08:28.660 line:85%
Oh, sorry, let me re-phrase that.

00:08:28.660 --> 00:08:30.250 line:85%
At least one of those is a skull!

00:08:30.250 --> 00:08:31.173 line:85%
<c.colorFFAAFF>Okay.</c>

00:08:32.200 --> 00:08:34.500 line:91%
You passed very early.
Rohin, the other one.

00:08:36.130 --> 00:08:38.230 line:91%
Yes!
<c.yellow>Wow.</c>

00:08:38.230 --> 00:08:39.712 line:91%
<c.colorFFAAFF>Turn away, and I'll show the camera
my last one.</c>

00:08:39.712 --> 00:08:41.579 line:91%
For the benefit of the count
and the audience.

00:08:42.750 --> 00:08:44.350 line:85%
We'll see how that— Thank you.

00:08:45.867 --> 00:08:48.321 line:91%
Right.
<c.colorFFAAFF>Point to you, Tom.</c>

00:08:48.321 --> 00:08:50.530 line:85%
<i>(sighs, laughs)</i>

00:08:50.530 --> 00:08:52.067 line:85%
I knew the minute I said four,

00:08:52.067 --> 00:08:53.700 line:91%
"Oh, I can get more
than that out of here,"

00:08:53.700 --> 00:08:55.290 line:85%
and I just instinctively...

00:08:56.220 --> 00:08:59.043 line:91%
I was sure you were going
to go for seven on that.

00:08:59.043 --> 00:09:00.380 line:85%
But, all right.

00:09:00.380 --> 00:09:02.311 line:85%
<c.colorFFAAFF>Did vaguely consider eight.</c>

00:09:02.311 --> 00:09:03.991 line:85%
<i>(laughs)</i>

00:09:03.991 --> 00:09:06.110 line:91%
Only you know if that
would have been a good bid.

00:09:06.110 --> 00:09:08.140 line:91%
<c.colorFFAAFF>Oh, yeah.
</c><c.colorEEEEEE>All right.</c>

00:09:08.140 --> 00:09:09.719 line:85%
So one card down.

00:09:09.719 --> 00:09:11.350 line:85%
<c.yellow>I'll go.</c>

00:09:11.350 --> 00:09:12.393 line:85%
And it's on me.

00:09:13.520 --> 00:09:17.190 position:63% line:85%
Ha, I'm tempted to immediately go three,

00:09:17.190 --> 00:09:21.120 line:91%
just to be a jackass,
but no, I'll play.

00:09:21.120 --> 00:09:21.953 line:85%
I'll play.

00:09:34.610 --> 00:09:35.443 line:85%
<c.yellow>Three.</c>

00:09:38.793 --> 00:09:42.280 line:91%
Logically, I need to bid four,
unless...

00:09:44.620 --> 00:09:46.920 position:61% line:85%
No, just 'cause I think that's a skull.

00:09:46.920 --> 00:09:48.423 line:85%
No, no, pass.

00:09:49.290 --> 00:09:50.610 line:91%
<c.yellow>Why would you think
that's a skull, though?</c>

00:09:50.610 --> 00:09:52.791 line:91%
<c.yellow>'Cause that I'm the first
one to turn the thing over,</c>

00:09:52.791 --> 00:09:54.260 line:85%
<c.yellow>so it doesn't make any sense.</c>

00:09:54.260 --> 00:09:55.093 line:85%
Yeah, I know.

00:09:55.093 --> 00:09:57.359 line:91%
I think you're trying to bait
me into bidding too high.

00:09:57.359 --> 00:09:59.670 line:91%
<c.colorFFAAFF>You just bid three. He's
he's using that information.</c>

00:09:59.670 --> 00:10:01.614 line:91%
If you were bidding four—
<c.yellow>What's wrong with bidding three?</c>

00:10:01.614 --> 00:10:02.620 line:85%
If you were bidding four or five—

00:10:02.620 --> 00:10:04.070 line:91%
<c.cyan>It's low enough that
someone else is going to bid</c>

00:10:04.070 --> 00:10:06.220 line:91%
<c.cyan>on-top of you, so you're
safe from going first</c>

00:10:06.220 --> 00:10:08.142 line:91%
<c.cyan>kind of thing.
</c><c.yellow>Right, right, right.</c>

